# Fast flick: release while the final delta is large enough to arm bounded inertia.

output-dir out/scroll_drag_inertia_frames
montage out/scroll_drag_inertia_montage.bmp
frames 14
step-ms 33
start-ms 1000
viewport 300 300
columns 4
gap 6

event 2 pointer-down 150 142
event 3 pointer-move 150 122
event 4 pointer-move 150 102
event 5 pointer-move 150 82
event 6 pointer-up 150 82
